{
  "name": "End-to-End AI YouTube Video Generator",
  "tags": [],
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ Setup — do this first\n\n1. Open **1. Config and API Keys** and replace the `YOUR_*` placeholders:\n   - **GEMINI_API_KEY** → create one in Google AI Studio\n   - **ELEVENLABS_API_KEY** → from your ElevenLabs account\n   - **ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID** → any voice ID (default is Rachel)\n   - **CREATOMATE_API_KEY** + **CREATOMATE_TEMPLATE_ID** → from your Creatomate project\n2. In your Creatomate template, name the caption element **Text** and the voiceover element **Audio**. If your element names differ, edit the body of **5. Creatomate (Render Video)** to match them.\n3. Attach your **YouTube OAuth2 API** credential to **7. Upload to YouTube**.\n\nThe voiceover MP3 is uploaded to tmpfiles.org so Creatomate can download it (files auto-delete after ~60 minutes). Swap that node for any public file host you prefer.\n\nVideos are uploaded as **private** by default. If your renders take longer than ~45 seconds, increase the **Wait for Video Render** node."
      },
      "id": "a1f0b2c3-1111-4a2b-9c3d-0f1e2d3c4b5a",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-80, -240]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🎬 What it does\n\nOne topic in → one finished Short out:\n\n1. **Gemini** writes the title, description, tags, an on-screen hook and a 40–50 word Hindi/Hinglish voiceover script\n2. **ElevenLabs** turns the script into an MP3 voiceover\n3. **tmpfiles.org** hosts the MP3 at a temporary public URL\n4. **Creatomate** renders the video template with the hook text and the voiceover\n5. n8n waits ~45 s, downloads the finished MP4 and uploads it to YouTube as **private**\n\n💡 To generate voiceovers in another language, edit the prompt in **2. Gemini (Script and Metadata)**."
      },
      "id": "a1f0b2c3-2222-4a2b-9c3d-0f1e2d3c4b5a",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Flow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [660, -240]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "b1e2d3f4-0001-4c5a-9b8c-1a2b3c4d5e6f",
      "name": "Start Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [100, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "k1",
              "name": "GEMINI_API_KEY",
              "value": "YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "k2",
              "name": "ELEVENLABS_API_KEY",
              "value": "YOUR_ELEVENLABS_API_KEY",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "k3",
              "name": "ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID",
              "value": "21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "k4",
              "name": "CREATOMATE_API_KEY",
              "value": "YOUR_CREATOMATE_API_KEY",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "k5",
              "name": "CREATOMATE_TEMPLATE_ID",
              "value": "YOUR_CREATOMATE_TEMPLATE_ID",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "k6",
              "name": "TOPIC",
              "value": "Top 3 Unbelievable Facts About Ancient India",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1e2d3f4-0002-4c5a-9b8c-1a2b3c4d5e6f",
      "name": "1. Config and API Keys",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [300, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-2.5-flash:generateContent",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "key",
              "value": "={{ $json.GEMINI_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ contents: [{ parts: [{ text: 'Act as an expert YouTube Shorts creator. Topic: ' + $json.TOPIC + '. Return strictly a valid JSON object with: \"title\" (under 90 chars), \"description\" (with 5 hashtags), \"tags\" (comma separated), \"hook_text\" (short 5-8 word caption for screen), and \"voiceover\" (exact 40-50 word Hindi/Hinglish voiceover script).' }] }], generationConfig: { responseMimeType: 'application/json' } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1e2d3f4-0003-4c5a-9b8c-1a2b3c4d5e6f",
      "name": "2. Gemini (Script and Metadata)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [520, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Clean and parse the JSON returned by Gemini\nconst raw = $input.first().json.candidates[0].content.parts[0].text;\nconst cleaned = raw.replace(/```json/gi, '').replace(/```/g, '').trim();\nconst parsed = JSON.parse(cleaned);\nconst cfg = $('1. Config and API Keys').first().json;\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      ...parsed,\n      elevenlabs_key: cfg.ELEVENLABS_API_KEY,\n      elevenlabs_voice_id: cfg.ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID,\n      creatomate_key: cfg.CREATOMATE_API_KEY,\n      template_id: cfg.CREATOMATE_TEMPLATE_ID,\n    },\n  },\n];"
      },
      "id": "b1e2d3f4-0004-4c5a-9b8c-1a2b3c4d5e6f",
      "name": "Parse Gemini Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [740, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1/text-to-speech/{{ $('Parse Gemini Output').first().json.elevenlabs_voice_id }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "xi-api-key",
              "value": "={{ $('Parse Gemini Output').first().json.elevenlabs_key }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ text: $('Parse Gemini Output').first().json.voiceover, model_id: 'eleven_multilingual_v2', voice_settings: { stability: 0.5, similarity_boost: 0.8 } }) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "b1e2d3f4-0005-4c5a-9b8c-1a2b3c4d5e6f",
      "name": "3. ElevenLabs (Voiceover Audio)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [960, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://tmpfiles.org/api/v1/upload",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "parameterType": "formBinaryData",
              "name": "file",
              "inputDataFieldName": "data"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1e2d3f4-0006-4c5a-9b8c-1a2b3c4d5e6f",
      "name": "4. Host Voiceover Audio (tmpfiles.org)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1180, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.creatomate.com/v1/renders",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $('Parse Gemini Output').first().json.creatomate_key }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ template_id: $('Parse Gemini Output').first().json.template_id, modifications: { 'Text': $('Parse Gemini Output').first().json.hook_text, 'Audio': $('4. Host Voiceover Audio (tmpfiles.org)').first().json.data.url.replace('tmpfiles.org/', 'tmpfiles.org/dl/') } } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1e2d3f4-0007-4c5a-9b8c-1a2b3c4d5e6f",
      "name": "5. Creatomate (Render Video)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1400, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 45,
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "id": "b1e2d3f4-0008-4c5a-9b8c-1a2b3c4d5e6f",
      "name": "Wait for Video Render",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1620, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('5. Creatomate (Render Video)').first().json[0].url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "b1e2d3f4-0009-4c5a-9b8c-1a2b3c4d5e6f",
      "name": "6. Download Rendered Video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1840, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "video",
        "operation": "upload",
        "title": "={{ $('Parse Gemini Output').first().json.title }}",
        "categoryId": "27",
        "binaryProperty": "data",
        "options": {
          "description": "={{ $('Parse Gemini Output').first().json.description }}",
          "privacyStatus": "private",
          "tags": "={{ $('Parse Gemini Output').first().json.tags }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "b1e2d3f4-0010-4c5a-9b8c-1a2b3c4d5e6f",
      "name": "7. Upload to YouTube",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.youtube",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2060, 300]
    }
  ],
